{"candidateAnswer":"Cooking techniques and gaming knowledge","evidence":"[D18:8 | 6:12 pm on 14 August, 2022] Nate: Thanks, Joanna! Your words mean a lot. Since we last spoke, I started teaching people how to make this. Sharing my love for dairy-free desserts has been fun and rewarding.\n[D26:12 | 3:56 pm on 4 November, 2022] Nate: Just been helping some friends reset their high scores at the international tournament. It's been fun!\n[D14:16 | 5:44 pm on 3 June, 2022] Nate: For sure! They asked for some tips in how to improve their game, so I said I could help.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3c303800-391e-56d0-ba39-b970cde5258d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:01f02de564fe3641906721e72c6c7de53442534d21617c13d9fcedc8057013d7","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are the skills that Nate has helped others learn?","referenceAnswer":"coconut milk ice cream recipe, reset high scores, tips to improve gaming skills","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"01f02de564fe3641906721e72c6c7de53442534d21617c13d9fcedc8057013d7"}}]}